#: ../../functions/func_firstalphachar.rst:6
msgid "$firstalphachar"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_firstalphachar.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$firstalphachar(text[,nonalpha])**"
msgstr "用法：**$firstalphachar(text[,nonalpha])**"

#: ../../functions/func_firstalphachar.rst:9
msgid "Category: text"
msgstr "类别：文本"

#: ../../functions/func_firstalphachar.rst:10
msgid "Implemented: Picard 0.12"
msgstr "实现：Picard 0.12"

#: ../../functions/func_firstalphachar.rst:12
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_firstalphachar.rst:14
msgid "Returns the first character of ``text`` in upper case. If ``text`` does not begin with an alphabetic character, then ``nonalpha`` is returned instead. If ``nonalpha`` is not specified, the default value \"#\" will be used."
msgstr ""
"返回 ``text`` 的第一个大写字符。如果 ``text`` 不是以字母字符开头，则返回 "
"``nonalpha``。如果未指定 ``nonalpha``，则将使用默认值 \"#\"。"

